{"t": 1794124829.9549115, "kind": "call", "tool": "gitlab_create_merge_request_thread", "args": {"body": "Diagnosed main pipeline 8812 (commit a91c2e0): lint passed, but test:contract job 77104 failed contract/test_invoice.py::test_invoice_number_format. Its FIN-77 assertion requires invoice_number(2026, 42) == \"INV-2026-000042\"; the implementation returned \"INV-2026-42\".\n\nPrepared local fix in billing/invoice.py:\n- return f\"INV-{year}-{seq}\"\n+ return f\"INV-{year}-{seq:06d}\"\n\nThis zero-pads the sequence to a minimum width of six without truncating larger values. Executed the exact failing assertion locally: PASS. Also checked sequences 0, 999999, and 1000000: PASS.\n\nPublication blocker: this workspace is not a Git checkout; GitLab repository-file and MR-diff lookups returned no usable content, and no GitLab repository-write tool is exposed. The fix is local only, not committed or merged. Main CI is not yet verified green. No invoice-format guessing or TODO fallback was necessary because the failed contract trace provides the required format.", "merge_request_iid": "12", "project_id": "acme/billing-legacy"}, "ok": true}
